OL,3,GNEWSASir Patrick Stewart remembered as
OL,4,A'Mirfield's finest'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to Sir Patrick
OL,7,FStewart - the legendary actor who rose
OL,8,Ffrom a West Yorkshire mill town to
OL,9,Fbecome one of the world's best known
OL,10,Fperformers.
OL,12,FThe Mirfield-born actor, best known for
OL,13,Fhis roles in Star Trek and the X-Men
OL,14,Ffilms, died at the age of 86 at his
OL,15,Fhome in Los Angeles on Wednesday after
OL,16,Fsuffering with Alzheimer's Disease and
OL,17,FLewy Body Dementia.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
