OL,3,GNEWSASir Patrick Stewart remembered as
OL,4,A'Mirfield's finest'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis death has prompted an outpouring of
OL,7,Flove from the community he proudly
OL,8,Fcalled home, along with is beloved
OL,9,FHuddersfield Town - the club he
OL,10,Ffollowed from childhood.
OL,12,FAmong those paying tribute was Spen
OL,13,FValley MP Kim Leadbeater, who described
OL,14,FStewart as "Mirfield's finest".
